{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "048mom_311_2_3_048_11_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:553c0f43bc820427db228eee13acefbc28679461428fe0b4d51ae5d867908518",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:048mom_311_2_3_048_11_09_a:2_3_048_11_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:526ccc0a44916930cf106d0605fd45dcbec8ba9f9ed3fbe631341123fd97a3c6",
      "text": "啊……喂喂。忽然好想听听●●●●●●●●●●P酱的声音，\n就忍不住打过来了。现在方便吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_311_2_3_048_11_09_a:2_3_048_11_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d84ede1c415918e6767334b3246a6950ab091359887924142e8d65336876e17",
      "text": "嗯，方便的哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_311_2_3_048_11_09_a:2_3_048_11_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bd39b2d8ef9b9a7c3031d8eef52bec8eeccdd900bb29e27dfef68e29a47ba9a",
      "text": "太好了。……那个啊，刚才，\n电视上播了我们出演的情人节CM哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_311_2_3_048_11_09_a:2_3_048_11_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26cf0f99b3fe1163fcc9ccf42eb6a56188fd86d54405aaa275f423553e58a804",
      "text": "明明屏幕里的人就是我自己，可看着看着，\n心里却突然涌起一阵难受的感觉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_311_2_3_048_11_09_a:2_3_048_11_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1d82f82e5dda2ff38e9eacccaf03fb9cd8728404c2f183d2b0d9defeb7e3208",
      "text": "要是自己也经历了一场无法开花结果的恋情，该怎么办呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_311_2_3_048_11_09_a:2_3_048_11_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c80a1e0033dab995354badd65e252ddc340c9c0b12aceb7b18e197bbca4f861",
      "text": "换作是你的话，在这种时候会怎么做呢？\n……对不起，突然问这种奇怪的问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_311_2_3_048_11_09_a:2_3_048_11_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21bd6c0dc40befd791b8f01fbd5b0d633710c60d60e746a4b0e66fd026bfbcaa",
      "text": "换作是我的话，\n无论何时都会倾听你的心声哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_311_2_3_048_11_09_a:2_3_048_11_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:608b03dd00dc905cf54d9984798b4de02c8557a50d3341d0ca5791a23ec3db34",
      "text": "……嗯，谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_311_2_3_048_11_09_a:2_3_048_11_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f89c9e739443344e776bdd4dc80e9723950bbe71aedf3c792f0af5628d8b9b04",
      "text": "是呢。因为P酱……\n无论何时，都会陪伴在我们的身旁。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_311_2_3_048_11_09_a:2_3_048_11_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1e1e01afafa0240740a2906ad41747d7f2afa404281db66c7f7f59806e95300",
      "text": "……谢谢你。\n等我又想听你的声音时，还会再打过来的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
